mareader-kokoro ports Kokoro's inference to Rust and candle.

The port follows any-tts 0.2.0 (https://github.com/TM9657/any-tts), its
Kokoro model: the layers, the source and STFT generator, phoneme chunking
and the phoneme fix-ups. any-tts is dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0; this
