The model itself, Kokoro-82M by hexgrad
(https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M), is Apache-2.0. Its weights and
voices are not part of this crate; the app downloads them on request. Kokoro
builds on StyleTTS 2 and iSTFTNet.
